e is no other way to send mail. Cannot be undone.\\nmove: Move a message to a label: the label is added and the message leaves the inbox. Changes the person's data; can be undone. Gmail has no folders: a folder is a label, moving takes the message out of the inbox, and `archive` only does that.\\nlabel: Add or remove labels on a message. Changes the person's data; can be undone. Labels are Gmail labels, named as Gmail shows them.\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"output_schema\":null,\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"command\"],\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"search\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"read\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"fetch_attachment\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"draft\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"update_draft\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"send\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"move\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"label\"}]},\"query\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":1000,\"description\":\"Words to search for\"}]},\"folder\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":200,\"description\":\"A label name, such as inbox\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":200,\"description\":\"A label name\"}]},\"from\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":320,\"description\":\"Sender address or name\"}]},\"after\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"RFC 3339 time with offset\"}]},\"before\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"RFC 3339 time with offset\"}]},\"unread\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"boolean\"}]},\"limit\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":1,\"maximum\":100,\"description\":\"At most this many results (default 25)\"}]},\"cursor\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"A cursor from the previous page, with the same arguments\"}]},\"message\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"A message handle 